{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2023-02-06 08:00:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY VIRGINIA PLUGS INTO ORACLE FOR DISTRIBUTION CONTROL AND OUTAGE RESTORATION', 'text': 'UTILITY TO BENEFIT FROM MORE RELIABLE, AUTOMATED NETWORK VISIBILITY AND FASTER, SAFER OUTAGE AND INTERRUPTION MANAGEMENT AUSTIN, TEXAS , FEB. 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOMINION ENERGY VIRGINIA IS IMPLEMENTING ORACLE UTILITIES OUTAGE MANAGEMENT SYSTEM\xa0AND NEW ADVANCED DISTRIBUTION MANAGEMENT (ADMS) CAPABILITIES IN ORACLE UTILITIES NETWORK MANAGEMENT SYSTEM TO\xa0HELP IMPROVE\xa0ITS NETWORK VISIBILITY, RELIABILITY, AND OUTAGE MANAGEMENT RESPONSE. THE EXPANDED PLATFORM WILL ALSO HELP THE UTILITY BETTER MANAGE INCREASED DATA FROM DISTRIBUTED ENERGY RESOURCES (DERS) AND MEET ITS REGULATORY REQUIREMENTS.'}